PART B  --  THE FINITE CHECK  (optimistic C<= 3; empirics-indicated C<= 4)
==============================================================================
  The peel threshold T_k = C(k)/margin_k.  Residual R_k = {primitive E,
  0 in E, |E|=k, max(E) < T_k}.  We exhaustively certify p_0(E) <= cap_k on R_k.
  Enumeration = pruned B&B (upward-closure); 'exh=True' means COMPLETE.
  NOTE: empirical sup|wDelta| ~3.9 => C=4 is the load-bearing threshold.

